OL,3,GNEWSAChild in 'critical' condition as
OL,4,Apolice continue murder investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA child remains in a critical condition
OL,7,Fand a murder investigation under way
OL,8,Ffollowing an incident at a house in
OL,9,FDungannon.
OL,11,FPolice say the body of a man was found
OL,12,Falongside the injured child, understood
OL,13,Fto be a girl, at a property in
OL,14,FLisnahull Road at about 11:00 BST on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FA woman who had sustained non-life
OL,18,Fthreatening injuries during the
OL,19,Fincident has been released from
OL,20,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
